# Cache strategy:
#  - Bootstrap files (index.html, flutter_bootstrap.js, flutter.js, main.dart.js,
#    manifest.json) → revalidate every request via ETag. Browser šalje If-None-Match
#    pa dobije 304 Not Modified (instant) ili novi sadržaj kad je deploy. Bez ovoga
#    iOS Safari servira stale main.dart.js (~3.3MB) tjednima jer immutable cache.
#  - Hashed assets (canvaskit, assets/) → immutable. URL-ovi se mijenjaju kad se
#    sadržaj promijeni pa je dugotrajno cachiranje sigurno.
#  - flutter_service_worker.js → no-store. Pipeline ide bez SW od v2.0.5, ali
#    legacy korisnici trebaju moći nadograditi SW na trenutno aktivnu verziju
#    (no-store sprjeci browser cache da serva stari SW shell).

/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate

/manifest.json
  Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate

/flutter_bootstrap.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate

/flutter.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate

/main.dart.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate

/flutter_service_worker.js
  Cache-Control: no-store

/canvaskit/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
